  "body": "Unlike with `maxlength`, the \"dirty value flag\" isn't mentioned at all in the actual meat of `minlength`'s definitions.\nTherefore, this removes the \"dirty value flag\" from `minlength`'s \"parameter lists\" (so to speak) since it's unnecessary.\nSee https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#setting-minimum-input-length-requirements:-the-minlength-attribute\n",
